        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peggy Seeger, Ewan MacColl\n- Roles: folksinger, singer-songwriter, record producer, actor, poet, playwright, labour activist\n- Places: Britain, England\n\nFacts:\n- Ewan MacColl was the stage name of James Henry Miller, who was born on 25 January 1915 and died on 22 October 1989.\n- Ewan MacColl was an English folk singer, songwriter, communist, labour activist, actor, poet, playwright, and record producer.\n- Peggy Seeger was born on June 17, 1935, and is an American folksinger.\n- Peggy Seeger has lived in Britain for more than 30 years.\n- Peggy Seeger was married to the singer and songwriter Ewan MacColl until his death in 1989.",
